  "operative_text": "Section 1 (C.R.S. 18-12-203(1)(b)): ON AND AFTER THE EFFECTIVE DATE OF THIS SUBSECTION (1)(b), is EITHER: (I) Twenty-one years of age or older; OR (II) (A) EIGHTEEN YEARS OF AGE OR OLDER; AND (B) ON ACTIVE DUTY IN, OR HONORABLY DISCHARGED FROM, ANY BRANCH OR RESERVE BRANCH OF THE UNITED STATES MILITARY FORCES, INCLUDING THE NATIONAL GUARD."
